#: ../../source/guide/linear_structures/stack.rst:10
#: aaf3a5fd7e57404f94b09d72907a45c7
msgid ""
"A **stack** is a fundamental linear data structure that follows the "
"**Last-In-First-Out (LIFO)** principle. Think of it like a stack of "
"plates: you can only add or remove plates from the top."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guide/linear_structures/stack.rst:33
#: a26f6bba36b545e1bdf0d26a2206f8ac
msgid ""
"This guide covers the theoretical foundations, algorithmic "
"implementation, and practical usage of stacks in the SDS library."
